sequenceDiagram
  participant M as Music element
  participant S as Shell page tsx
  participant D as DJ route
  participant G as Groq
  participant T as TTS route
  participant E as ElevenLabs
  M->>S: ended event for current preview
  S->>M: set src to next preview and play
  S->>M: volume to 26 pct of user level
  S->>D: POST current next queueSize flowIndex and host fields
  D->>G: chat completion llama 3.1 8b max_tokens 70
  G-->>D: one spoken line under 22 words
  D-->>S: line or canned fallback with HTTP 200
  S->>T: POST delivery tag plus line voiceId and settings
  T->>E: text to speech eleven_v3 with server side key
  E-->>T: audio mpeg bytes
  T-->>S: blob to object url on primed element
  S->>S: play voice while music stays at bed level
  S->>M: restore volume when voice ends
